{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588520/extras/main_demo.jpg?t=1742867821\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">My Township Demo Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Start with a small farm settlement and grow it into a thriving metropolis</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tons of Arcade style mini games\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Limitless design opportunities\u2014build the metropolis of your dreams!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Develop and decorate and manage your town, produce and gather goods, and complete your townies tasks and orders!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Construct and upgrade buildings to improve productivity and townies well-being.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every villager has unique skills, needs, and personalities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Assign towns people to jobs to keep the city running.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Train and develop towns people to unlock their full potential.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The choices you make shape your towns/city\u2019s legacy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sandbox play and more..</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588520/extras/trailer3-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1742867821\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your task in this demo is to build the best town/city ever. In this immersive city-building game, you\u2019re not just an overseer; you\u2019re the guiding force of a growing civilization. Begin with a modest farm settlement and transform it into a sprawling metropolis, with every townie, building, and resource under your command. Carefully manage resources to keep your towns people thriving and happy as they work, learn, and grow under your direction. Customize every aspect of the city by upgrading buildings, assigning jobs, and planning expansions to accommodate the community\u2019s evolving needs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3588520?t=1742867821","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3588520?t=1742867821","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588520/45bd074fb54e820a1017f16ee4e6ae1f752e3a35/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742867821","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588520/45bd074fb54e820a1017f16ee4e6ae1f752e3a35/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742867821","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588520/extras/main_demo.jpg?t=1742867821\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">My Township Demo Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Start with a small farm settlement and grow it into a thriving metropolis</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tons of Arcade style mini games\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Limitless design opportunities\u2014build the metropolis of your dreams!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Develop and decorate and manage your town, produce and gather goods, and complete your townies tasks and orders!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Construct and upgrade buildings to improve productivity and townies well-being.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every villager has unique skills, needs, and personalities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Assign towns people to jobs to keep the city running.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Train and develop towns people to unlock their full potential.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The choices you make shape your towns/city\u2019s legacy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sandbox play and more..</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588520/extras/trailer3-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1742867821\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your task in this demo is to build the best town/city ever. In this immersive city-building game, you\u2019re not just an overseer; you\u2019re the guiding force of a growing civilization. Begin with a modest farm settlement and transform it into a sprawling metropolis, with every townie, building, and resource under your command. Carefully manage resources to keep your towns people thriving and happy as they work, learn, and grow under your direction. Customize every aspect of the city by upgrading buildings, assigning jobs, and planning expansions to accommodate the community\u2019s evolving needs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p>","developers":["Erkurheart Inc."],"fullgame":{"appid":"3581820","name":"My Township"},"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588520/025bcc65d673f072aae06af99e4de2cb7c7c2e8e/header.jpg?t=1742867821","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257113593,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257113593/movie480.mp4?t=1742867815","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257113593/movie_max.mp4?t=1742867815"},"name":"Townies","thumbnai